"Scott Pilgrim vs. The World (Scott Pilgrim, #2)",Bryan Lee O'Malley,,https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1348115004l/29801._SX50_.jpg,https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/16807.Bryan_Lee_O_Malley,"Does Scott and Ramona's burgeoning relationship have a future? Isn't Scott still supposedly dating Knives Chau? Who is Ramona's second evil ex-boyfriend, and why is he in Toronto? Who are The Clash At Demonhead, and what kind of bizarre art-punky music do they play? Who's their hot girl keyboardist, and what is Scott's relation to her? Why is The Clash At Demonhead Knives Chau's new favourite band? Fights! Drama! Secrets revealed! The answers to all these questions and more!",,,"['Graphic Novels', 'Comics', 'Fiction', 'Young Adult', 'Graphic Novels Comics', 'Manga', 'Fantasy']"
"The Sandman, Vol. 10: The Wake (Hardcover)",Neil Gaiman,4.51,https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1339922545l/25104._SY75_.jpg,https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/1221698.Neil_Gaiman,"Serijal o Sendmenu, nastao iz pera slavnog Nila Gejmana, rasko≈°na je me≈°avina modernog mita i mraƒçne fantastike, u kojoj ima i sada≈°njice, istorijske drame i raznih legendi. Smatra se jednim od najoriginalnijih i umetniƒçki najambicioznijih stripskih serijala na≈°eg vremena, koji je umnogome uticao na sazrevanje stripa kao umetnosti. Rekolorisano izdanje pred vama, pored samog stripa, donosi i dodatne materijale, ilustracije i tekstove, koji ƒáe upotpuniti jedinstven do≈æivljaj uranjanja u bogato izma≈°tan Sendmenov svet. Glavni lik Sendmena je san, taƒçnije ‚Äì personifikacija sna. Poznat je i kao Morfej, ali i pod mnogim drugim imenima, i jedan je od sedam Svevremenih... Na poƒçetku ovog slavnog serijala, koji se odvija u Morfejevom svetu snova, ali i u stvarnom, savremenom svetu (ponekad i drugde: u Paklu, vilinskom svetu ili Asgardu), Morfej je tokom okultnog rituala zatoƒçen i sedamdeset godina je proveo kao su≈æanj. On, meƒëutim, uspeva da pobegne i, po≈°to se osvetio onima koji su ga uhvatili, kreƒáe da obnovi svoje kraljevstvo, koje je oronulo i propalo tokom njegovog odsustva... Iako je, posle toliko godina u zatoƒçeni≈°tvu, Morfejeva kruta i katkad okrutna narav donekle smek≈°ala, nekome ko je navikao da eonima suvereno vlada mo≈æe biti veoma te≈°ko da prihvati neminovnost i nu≈ænost promene i poku≈°a da ra≈°ƒçini negda≈°nje grehe...",51980.0,1996.0,"['Graphic Novels', 'Comics', 'Fantasy', 'Fiction', 'Graphic Novels Comics', 'Horror', 'Comic Book']"
"Saga, Volume 7 (Paperback)",Brian K. Vaughan,,https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1642677880l/29237211._SY75_.jpg,https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/24514.Brian_K_Vaughan,"From the worldwide bestselling team of Fiona Staples and Brian K. Vaughan, ‚ÄúThe War for Phang‚Äù is an epic, self-contained Saga event! Finally reunited with her ever-expanding family, Hazel travels to a war-torn comet that Wreath and Landfall have been battling over for ages. New friendships are forged and others are lost forever in this action-packed volume about families, combat and the refugee experience. Collects: Saga #37-42.",,,"['Graphic Novels', 'Comics', 'Fantasy', 'Science Fiction', 'Fiction', 'Graphic Novels Comics', 'Adult']"
